# Images built from the repository root copy only what their Dockerfile names; this keeps
# build output, secrets and large local files out of the build context.
.git
**/bin
**/obj
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.gguf
src/Ehr.Design/wwwroot/lib
infra/compose/certs
infra/compose/models
